- Get token: `ios-app-manager push token`
- Send push: `ios-app-manager push send --token <token> [--env dev|prod] [--payload <file>]`

### DSL entrypoints

- Query: `ios-app-manager q '<query>'`
- Mutation: `ios-app-manager m '<mutation>'`

